# Chapter 7 (Introduction to Cryptography) — pain points & missing machinery

A log kept WHILE transliterating Chapter 7, recording what the 2b4m language or
standard library lacked at the moment it blocked a proof. Entries that are ADDRESSED
get removed rather than annotated — what remains is what is still missing. Plain
markdown without a `.md` extension so the literate checker never parses the fenced
